[{"sha":"455ac67445a04af9af229a7ad753923768b97423","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDQ1NWFjNjc0NDVhMDRhZjlhZjIyOWE3YWQ3NTM5MjM3NjhiOTc0MjM","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/455ac67445a04af9af229a7ad753923768b97423","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/455ac67445a04af9af229a7ad753923768b97423","author":{"name":"Dan Cunningham","email":"dan@digitaldan.com","date":"2026-10-06T16:03:55Z"},"committer":{"name":"Dan Cunningham","email":"dan@digitaldan.com","date":"2026-10-06T16:03:55Z"},"tree":{"sha":"5cf5316d8ed428309ad8b2e8f6eab9c018d89fc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/5cf5316d8ed428309ad8b2e8f6eab9c018d89fc7"},"message":"fix(poll): never delete an online node\n\nHi, thanks for the awesome project, i have been a happy user for awhile, using this for both my personal tsnet, as well as some other projects i maintain or am involved in.\n\nI ran into a very rare race condition where a node tried reconnecting as headscale was handling the disconnect, causing the GC to be scheduled even thought the node reconnected and was healthy.  Unfortunately, the GC would delete the node, which caused the client to get in a unhealthy state.  Its a very, very short window this could happen, i was just unlucky enough to run into it.\n\nThe exact sequence for this to happen:\n\n1. The old session marks it offline.\n2. The new session marks it online and cancels the GC timer.\n3. The old session then arms the timer.\n\nThe node is still online, but it gets deleted when the timer fires.\n\nRelated PR's that helped with similar race conditions, but does not quite protect against this.\n\n- #3298 drops a deletion whose timer was cancelled.\n- #3308 stops overlapping sessions from marking a node offline.\n- #3383 cancels the timer only after Connect.\n\nThis PR has 2 changes:\n1. Don't arm a timer for a node that is back online\n2. Never delete an online node (failsafe for possible other conditions not identified yet)\n\nAlso includes tests.\n\nSigned-off-by: Dan Cunningham <dan@digitaldan.com>","parents":[{"sha":"eeaac680bef26585c8cc1569f949e26d0d6aba80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/eeaac680bef26585c8cc1569f949e26d0d6aba80","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/eeaac680bef26585c8cc1569f949e26d0d6aba80"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":32617319205,"node_id":"RRE_lADOEFLz888AAAABVaOKJ88AAAAHmCTLJQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/32617319205","actor":{"login":"digitaldan","id":1903737,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MDM3Mzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1903737?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/digitaldan","html_url":"https://github.com/digitaldan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/digitaldan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/digitaldan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/digitaldan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/digitaldan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/digitaldan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/digitaldan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/digitaldan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/digitaldan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/digitaldan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"review_requested","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-10-06T16:17:05Z","review_requester":{"login":"digitaldan","id":1903737,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MDM3Mzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1903737?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/digitaldan","html_url":"https://github.com/digitaldan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users